# Zintus CODEOWNERS — DOMAIN MAP (documentation only)
#
# ⚠️ NOT ENFORCED via branch protection.
# Every owner here is the same single account (solo founder), so wiring
# "require review from code owners" would block you from merging your own PRs
# (GitHub forbids self-approval). Keep this file as a MAP, not a gate.
#
# Purpose: given a changed path, tell the agent WHICH context doc to read first.
#   path under here   → read this doc          → owning "agent domain"
#   packages/router   → docs/agents/CORE.md     → CORE
#   workers/, .github → docs/agents/OPS.md       → OPS
#   apps/gateway      → docs/agents/GATEWAY.md   → GATEWAY
#   apps/web          → docs/agents/WEB.md       → WEB
#   apps/mobile       → docs/agents/MOBILE.md    → MOBILE
#   apps/cli          → docs/agents/CLI.md       → CLI
#   apps/desktop      → docs/agents/DESKTOP.md   → DESKTOP
#
# Last matching pattern wins (standard CODEOWNERS rule).

# DEFAULT
*                           @trustphoneapp

# ── CORE — routing, compression, quota, crypto, schemas, providers ──
# Risk: HIGH (every request flows through here). Doc: docs/agents/CORE.md
/packages/router/           @trustphoneapp
/packages/tokzen/           @trustphoneapp
/packages/engine/           @trustphoneapp
/packages/crypto-e2e/       @trustphoneapp
/packages/schemas/          @trustphoneapp
/packages/providers/        @trustphoneapp

# ── OPS — relay, CI, Docker, deploy ──
# Risk: HIGH (affects all users on deploy). Doc: docs/agents/OPS.md
/workers/                   @trustphoneapp
/.github/                   @trustphoneapp
/Dockerfile                 @trustphoneapp
/docker-compose.yml         @trustphoneapp
/scripts/                   @trustphoneapp

# ── GATEWAY — the local API server ──
# Risk: HIGH (main API surface). Doc: docs/agents/GATEWAY.md
/apps/gateway/              @trustphoneapp

# ── WEB — marketing site + dashboard ──
# Risk: MEDIUM (UI, not data). Doc: docs/agents/WEB.md
/apps/web/                  @trustphoneapp

# ── MOBILE — Expo app ── Doc: docs/agents/MOBILE.md
/apps/mobile/               @trustphoneapp

# ── DESKTOP — Tauri app ── Doc: docs/agents/DESKTOP.md
/apps/desktop/              @trustphoneapp

# ── CLI — published npm package ── Doc: docs/agents/CLI.md
/apps/cli/                  @trustphoneapp

# ── SHARED PACKAGES (read CORE.md for the request-path ones) ──
/packages/memory/           @trustphoneapp
/packages/keychain/         @trustphoneapp
/packages/test-utils/       @trustphoneapp
/packages/search/           @trustphoneapp
/packages/context-compiler/ @trustphoneapp
/packages/codebase-indexer/ @trustphoneapp
/packages/types/            @trustphoneapp
/packages/ui/               @trustphoneapp
